id: pm-test-measure-prerequisite
title: Expose the test measurement run prerequisite in help and recovery
description: "A real delivery workflow tried pm test <id> --measure focused_tests=76 and received --measure requires --run. Command help only says Record name=value evidence, and recovery points to generic item/help commands rather than an executable same-intent test retry. Preserve the fail-closed requirement, declare the prerequisite in help/contracts, and supply an actionable minimal recovery without weakening clone-local linked-test trust."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:contracts","horizon:future"
created_at: "2026-10-09T20:48:23.014Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-11T03:34:29.612Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-11T03:34:28.904Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-11T03:34:28.904Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Help and machine contracts state the run prerequisite; a measurement-only request refuses before mutation with an executable same-intent recovery; linked-test trust and sandbox isolation remain enforced; behavioral negative controls and generated surface parity pass without token budget relaxation.
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Delivered the pure public SDK run prerequisite with selector/tracker/actor/background-preserving recovery and separate trust acknowledgement. The execution prerequisite excludes empty, skipped, untrusted and spawn failures, and reuses authoritative empty-summary detection across stdout/stderr even on failed exits before stored measurement summaries change."
expected_result: Empty summaries cannot support measurement evidence regardless of exit status or output stream; genuine executed failures and mixed selections retain valid measurements and refused calls preserve authoritative history.
actual_result: "Four pre-fix remediation regressions fail, including both failed-empty output streams. All 208 linked measurement/serializer/dispatch tests pass with history and stored-summary preservation. Full static/typecheck/docs and serialized nine-package version2026.10.11 npm/Bun/SDK consumers pass; final-head hosted gates and renewed full review remain mandatory."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-reliability-window-delivery,discovered_from,"2026-10-09T20:48:23.014Z","harness:codex","cli:create:dep",detected
comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-09T20:48:23.014Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full 2912-item all-status corpus plus the new delivery record were checked for --measure prerequisites and conditional help/recovery coverage; no equivalent item exists. Existing pm-n7rr is the grammar umbrella and is reused as parent. This observed UX follow-up remains open and unclaimed; it is not part of the completed SDK reliability implementation."
  "2026-10-10T18:18:21.523Z","harness:codex","Live intake: complete 2918-item all-status corpus, full item/history verification and GitHub security inventories are clean. Delivery groups SDK-owned measurement prerequisite recovery with registry-derived misplaced-namespace recovery and runner qualification diagnostics. Preserve linked-test trust, original selectors and measurement values; recovery must refuse before any write and retry without adding ownership or trust overrides."
  "2026-10-10T18:57:24.052Z","harness:codex","Verification refinements preserve all help token ceilings: shortened CLI prerequisite wording rather than ratcheting any budget. Real installed npx uses the once-installed exact tarball consumer to avoid repeated npm reification; bunx retains a fresh owned temporary cache. The linked command now executes a real node:assert check via node -e, which works through Bunx Node compatibility shims; bare node --version under that launcher refused with Missing script, an external launcher behavior rather than a trusted-run policy failure. Refusal/retry logic and complete authoritative byte checks are shared across direct executables and packed consumers."
  "2026-10-10T19:25:27.998Z","harness:codex","Static-gate investigation found that the measurement recovery imported the Commander registration module, pulling its runtime-primitives graph into the testing SDK. Extracting the existing pure argv builders into SDK test command-args and retaining the old registration exports preserves compatibility while removing that unnecessary framework dependency. Host control failure remains separate evidence and does not prove historical runner ownership."
  "2026-10-10T19:46:27.546Z","harness:codex","Final local receipts: the linked measurement and existing-export compatibility runs passed 107 tests and recorded both executions. The full Node24 suite passed 10111 tests with exact100/100/100/100 coverage before the later pure argv extraction; the extraction then passed144 focused tests and typecheck. Every static component now passes, including both real Node24 startup gates, context and record integrity, and the mutation guard (329 killed plus7 recognized equivalents; zero survivors). Serialized packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance passed with nine packages and the TypeScript SDK consumer; both refused namespace forms preserve authoritative bytes and the trusted measurement recovery executes an actual assertion. Final-head full coverage is also enforced in PR CI."
  "2026-10-10T19:50:50.463Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1436 contains the SDK prerequisite producer, pure retry serialization, generated contracts, linked tests, installed-artifact acceptance and this immutable closure evidence. Initial source commit a279913ba is implemented and locally verified; final-head full coverage and hosted review remain required before merge. Latest pm-changelog2026.10.5 generated and checked the Unreleased entry."
  "2026-10-10T20:08:47.389Z","harness:codex","PR #1436 review at 2e59d2e897f253cf40ce26f1bc017b17aadee409 verified numeric SDK selector loss, incomplete acknowledgement guidance, and the background measurement refusal bypass. Reopened for a shared SDK prerequisite guard, preserved selectors and trust intent, and targeted negative controls before final-head CI."
  "2026-10-10T20:22:07.023Z","harness:codex",The shared prerequisite guard is now exported from the public SDK so package authors can validate custom dispatch without a private import or CLI dependency. Its SDK signature and real typed refusal are included in the installed TypeScript/runtime consumer proof. CLI/SDK import-boundary checks remain unchanged; the generated contract catalog now attributes the code to sdk/test/prerequisites.ts.
  "2026-10-10T20:35:01.998Z","harness:codex","Review remediation verified: 366 focused tests pass; all 3 linked runs pass (72 SDK/real-CLI tests, 37 serializer tests, 90 dispatch tests). Serialized packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance passes for 9 packages, with installed SDK declaration compilation and a real public-guard typed refusal. Static source, SDK import boundary, contracts, token/grammar, tracker/graph/record assurance, unchanged qualified SDK/CLI performance budgets and mutation gates pass after regenerating the guard source attribution. Published PR head 2e59d2 already passed exact 100/100/100/100 CI coverage; the next head must pass fresh coverage before merge. No trust or ownership override was added."
  "2026-10-10T22:18:31.102Z","harness:codex","PR #1436 final-head review https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1436#pullrequestreview-5480989632: runTest accepts --run --measure with empty or skipped results and buildTrackedTestRunSummary stores the supplied measurements. Require actual execution evidence before recording measurements, retaining read-only refusal recovery and trust policy."
  "2026-10-10T22:50:34.917Z","harness:codex","Final-control review remediation: e54eb10 pre-fix negative controls reproduced fabricated measurements with no links, a legacy path-only skipped selection, an untrusted command and a recognized zero-test runner. The corrected skipped fixture uses imported metadata as existing skip tests do; its independent detached pre-fix execution resolved ok=true with a skipped result and a stored coverage=100 measurement. The SDK now refuses these runs with test_measure_requires_execution before recording summaries, preserves history bytes, and provides selected-tracker read-only inspection argv. Mixed real/skipped and executed failed commands retain measurements and correct result status. All linked tests pass, including 206 measurement/dispatch/serializer assertions; typecheck and the complete static pipeline pass after regenerated contracts, catalog, refusal census and additive SDK error-code snapshot. Required exact coverage remains a fresh CI obligation for the next published head."
  "2026-10-11T03:16:00.410Z","harness:codex","PR #1436 full review at 0fafb51020df68a2b423bf0541ac6e33a5150504, https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1436#discussion_r4240078408: a No test files found command exiting 1 is classified assertion_failure and bypasses the measurement empty-run exclusion. Reopen this owner, reproduce with real stdout and stderr failure commands, reuse the existing authoritative empty-output detector, and preserve executed-failure/mixed evidence."
  "2026-10-11T03:20:31.497Z","harness:codex","Four independent pre-fix regressions fail: failed-empty stdout, failed-empty stderr, control-ceiling classification and omitted launcher ENOENT. Measurement now reuses detectEmptyLinkedTestRun in the execution prerequisite, so empty summaries are authoritative across both output streams and failed exits; a genuine executed stdout-only failure still supports measurement evidence. Focused corrected commands pass 117 assertions with one Windows-only skip; existing history and stored-summary preservation assertions remain enabled."
  "2026-10-11T03:34:28.294Z","harness:codex","Final failed-empty remediation receipts: the independent previous implementation resolves failed empty stdout and stderr runs with stored measurements; corrected requests refuse test_measure_requires_execution and preserve history/summary bytes. All three linked runs pass 208 tests, including genuinely executed failures and mixed selections. Full static/typecheck, docs links and serialized nine-package 2026.10.11 npm/npx/Bun/bunx/SDK consumers pass without altered budgets or trust. The existing empty-summary detector remains shared rather than copied; fresh final-head hosted checks and full review are required."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T20:23:36.196Z","harness:codex","Executable recovery must preserve the SDK value domain, including numeric test indexes. Validate shared execution prerequisites before alternate CLI dispatch paths, export reusable guards through the SDK, and keep acknowledgement distinct from execution so a recovery suggestion cannot confer trust."
